{
  "description": "The creature is a single four-legged equine shown in strict right-facing profile against a plain off-white background. Its body is covered in short brown fur that is darker along the back, neck and outer legs and paler on the muzzle, underbelly and inner legs. It has a long narrow head with a white muzzle, a short upright bristly mane along the neck, two large upright ears, a barrel-shaped torso, four slender legs ending in hooves, and a thin tail with a dark tuft at the tip. It is standing with all four feet on the ground in a naturalistic, detailed illustration style.",
  "parts": [
    {
      "part": "head",
      "looks_like": "elongated and narrow with a brown face, white fur around the nose and mouth, a dark nostril, a dark eye with a light ring around it, and wrinkled skin on the muzzle and lower neck",
      "where": "at the far right end of the body, facing to the right"
    },
    {
      "part": "ears",
      "looks_like": "two large, tall, pointed and upright ears with brown outer fur, lighter gray-white inner fur with dark patches inside, and dark tufted tips",
      "where": "on top of the head, one slightly behind the other in profile view"
    },
    {
      "part": "mane",
      "looks_like": "short, stiff, erect bristles that are dark brown to black with lighter tips, forming a spiky crest",
      "where": "along the dorsal midline of the neck from just behind the ears to the top of the shoulders"
    },
    {
      "part": "legs",
      "looks_like": "four slender, straight legs with visible joints, musculature and brown fur that is lighter on the inner and lower portions",
      "where": "underneath the body, two forelegs at the front under the chest and two hind legs at the rear under the hips"
    },
    {
      "part": "feet",
      "looks_like": "four rounded, solid hooves with a light gray-brown keratinous surface and a slightly darker edge at the base of each leg",
      "where": "at the bottom tip of each leg, in contact with the ground"
    },
    {
      "part": "tail",
      "looks_like": "a thin, sparsely haired tail with short brown hair along its length and a longer, darker brown bushy tuft at the end",
      "where": "at the extreme left rear of the body, hanging vertically downward from the rump"
    },
    {
      "part": "markings",
      "looks_like": "subtle color variation with a slightly darker dorsal area along the back, a paler creamy underbelly and inner legs, and a white patch on the muzzle; no distinct spots or stripes beyond shading",
      "where": "across the torso, belly, legs and face"
    }
  ],
